ind":"paragraph"},"citation":"18.55.040","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/18.55.040","content_hash":"ae0c3b1b73deac8f31be34f93542ce673df7dfc87f7836d6f8f9274e24585a17","heading":null,"ordinal":9,"parent_source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.55.040:section","schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.55.040:block:9","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/18.55.040","text":"(1) A physical or mental impairment which substantially limits one or more of such person’s major life activities;","type":"paragraph","workbench_component_id":"06e1aaf8-c9c3-51e3-ac72-3b78f17c4932"},{"attributes":{"block_kind":"paragraph"},"citation":"18.55.040","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/18.55.040","content_hash":"235caf91f305f2cd966eb1813aac02b56e1ac75975a1aa04a07e89e8478f2c26","heading":null,"ordinal":10,"parent_source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.55.040:section","schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.55.040:block:10","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/18.55.040","text":"(2) A record of having such an impairment; or","type":"paragraph","workbench_component_id":"45fbe780-7bcd-52ac-9ac1-353b4e214124"},{"attributes":{"block_kind":"paragraph"},"citation":"18.55.040","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/18.55.040","content_hash":"edb43449e73d83136cc5893d1412c10939eb8cdcdb8d205a8be2038bc30c0488","heading":null,"ordinal":11,"parent_source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.55.040:section","schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.55.040:block:11","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/18.55.040","text":"(3) Being regarded as having such an impairment.","type":"paragraph","workbench_component_id":"9c4f0cc3-a827-5628-a97b-31a0f8ebc20e"},{"attributes":{"block_kind":"paragraph"},"citation":"18.55.040","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/18.55.040","content_hash":"21314c3d1ad38083ef7d7aa9426f88fedb90fbd2814f4b9380e6758ce7f03136","heading":null,"ordinal":12,"parent_source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.55.040:section","schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.55.040:block:12","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/18.55.040","text":"Such term does not include current, illegal use or addiction to a controlled substance, as defined in Section 102 of the Controlled Substance Act ( 21 U.S.C. Section 802 ).","type":"paragraph","workbench_component_id":"cb6fd212-de15-55f9-b18a-0efa0c500d10"},{"attributes":{"block_kind":"paragraph"},"citation":"18.55.040","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/18.55.040","content_hash":"854609ed34173e876e7b164dc1f92aeb98485b9587123461980ca6c7118c902b","heading":null,"ordinal":13,"parent_source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.55.040:section","schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.55.040:block:13","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/18.55.040","text":"“District” means any section of the jurisdiction for which the regulations governing the use of buildings and premises or the height and area of buildings are uniform.","type":"paragraph","workbench_component_id":"3b834f01-aeb1-5d13-b97e-12df244a1b79"},{"attributes":{"block_kind":"paragraph"},"citation":"18.55.040","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/18.55.040","content_hash":"9774c7f00da5d39a16fd7a71a9e6cac4315fbea43bf8d92714459bb095b3bf10","heading":null,"ordinal":14,"parent_source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.55.040:section","schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.55.040:block:14","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/18.55.040","text":"“District map” means the boundaries of the zoning districts as they presently exist or as they may from time to time be amended as shown upon the district map on file in the office of the Planning Director, which boundaries shall have the same force and effect as though fully set forth or described herein.","type":"paragraph","workbench_component_id":"ec5a7108-c16d-5ed7-8ece-f45a9dc7a71a"},{"attributes":{"block_kind":"paragraph"},"citation":"18.55.040","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/18.55.040","content_hash":"e220d32d9fec1a365b3171eac887024706fa58b7d2452d543d731f966b09710c","heading":null,"ordinal":15,"parent_source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.55.040:section","schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.55.040:block:15","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/18.55.040","text":"“Domestic animal” means small animals that are customarily kept for personal use or enjoyment such as, but not limited to, dogs, cats, tropical birds, rabbits and rodents.","type":"paragraph","workbench_component_id":"3192cb62-c95f-52cd-9b59-cae7e8dc5a95"},{"attributes":{"block_kind":"paragraph"},"citation":"18.55.040","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/18.55.040","content_hash":"9f021e8049f128f227672120b6311520b58e8077cbc9f72db258ab060163cd0d","heading":null,"ordinal":16,"parent_source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.55.040:section","schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.55.040:block:16","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/18.55.040","text":"“Dormitory” means a building or part of a building operated by an institution and containing a room or rooms forming one or more habitable units which are used or intended to be used by residents of the institution for living and sleeping, but not for cooking or eating purposes.","type":"paragraph","workbench_component_id":"3452457d-64ac-540a-8d8f-08223a044aa1"},{"attributes":{"block_kind":"paragraph"},"citation":"18.55.040","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/18.55.040","content_hash":"090db451f017769311f83710fa12fe46c8989b45b2778637d72d8486ec73fd4a","heading":null,"ordinal":17,"parent_source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.55.040:section","schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.55.040:block:17","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/18.55.040","text":"“Drinking establishment” means premises which may be open to the general public, where alcoholic liquor by the individual drink is sold.","type":"paragraph","workbench_component_id":"73ebfee7-c3d3-55e7-b5e1-59848c1c2444"},{"attributes":{"block_kind":"paragraph"},"citation":"18.55.040","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/18.55.040","content_hash":"919c925cb35a6bafa403b418063119b232af5118ccff8d33766b2b5c5f67cedc","heading":null,"ordinal":18,"parent_source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.55.040:section","schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.55.040:block:18","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/18.55.040","text":"“Driveway” means a paved surface designed to provide vehicular access to a parking area.","type":"paragraph","workbench_component_id":"62ef2d1d-3207-517b-aa25-39ad6b8a73b4"},{"attributes":{"block_kind":"paragraph"},"citation":"18.55.040","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/18.55.040","content_hash":"88c6320ed17e378a87839b393e4062bb9fa9ee25a0cb133b3f90bc5a3e7f550f","heading":null,"ordinal":19,"parent_source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.55.040:section","schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.55.040:block:19","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/18.55.040","text":"“Dwelling” means a building or portion thereof, used exclusively for residential occupancy, including one-family, two-family and multiple-family dwellings, but not including hotels, motels, boarding houses, house trailers and mobile homes.","type":"paragraph","workbench_component_id":"34c7fcde-085b-5ac5-8b1c-a135dc6dfb54"},{"attributes":{"block_kind":"paragraph"},"citation":"18.55.040","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/18.55.040","content_hash":"c01b39c9bb268c543264d1c36a707dd3d8295d32dd46ee878cc79a8ca080f902","heading":null,"ordinal":20,"parent_source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.55.040:section","schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.55.040:block:20","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/18.55.040","text":"“Dwelling, attached” means a one-family dwelling attached to two or more one-family dwellings by common vertical walls.","type":"paragraph","workbench_component_id":"4fa1a2f2-2a5e-5565-8329-eed5617c5c40"},{"attributes":{"block_kind":"paragraph"},"citation":"18.55.040","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/18.55.040","content_hash":"2a253efbdfefc604cd9d1ae37f1c69c94524f1d3d71bed483281cba4c2915b42","heading":null,"ordinal":21,"parent_source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.55.040:section","schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.55.040:block:21","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/18.55.040","text":"“Dwelling, detached” means a dwelling which is designed to be and is substantially separate from any other structure or structures except accessory buildings.","type":"paragraph","workbench_component_id":"05b2ff1f-8c26-56eb-b01b-949c891d8b3d"},{"attributes":{"block_kind":"paragraph"},"citation":"18.55.040","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/18.55.040","content_hash":"2c4f159267f0d161eccecf925372da452855cd7981f60ed99419c399ccd7be99","heading":null,"ordinal":22,"parent_source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.55.040:section","schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.55.040:block:22","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/18.55.040","text":"“Dwelling, multiple-family” means a building or portion thereof used for occupancy by three or more families living independently of each other, and doing their own cooking in the building, including apartments, group houses, and row houses.","type":"paragraph","workbench_component_id":"70df2552-7730-5ae1-8647-cd3d5cf933cd"},{"attributes":{"block_kind":"paragraph"},"citation":"18.55.040","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/18.55.040","content_hash":"0b735b35cd80c3fdf3c0070a1873ed707771be8ea4ffdb558ff5cdb25ff07828","heading":null,"ordinal":23,"parent_source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.55.040:section","schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.55.040:block:23","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/18.55.040","text":"“Dwelling, row house or townhouse” means one of a series of three or more attached dwelling units separated from one another by continuous vertical party walls without openings from basement floor to roof.","type":"paragraph","workbench_component_id":"1a004275-1589-5d5f-a61b-114e52ec6675"},{"attributes":{"block_kind":"paragraph"},"citation":"18.55.040","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/18.55.040","content_hash":"a121c717c68da6cab371eed663df36d2e3a4d0f3c219eb92336f9eb42dcc6a7b","heading":null,"ordinal":24,"parent_source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.55.040:section","schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.55.040:block:24","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/18.55.040","text":"“Dwelling, single-family” means a building designed and/or used exclusively for residential purposes for one family only and containing not more than one unit, including site-built homes and residential-design manufactured homes, but not including house trailers and mobile homes as defined by this chapter.","type":"paragraph","workbench_component_id":"63fcb8ed-d473-5ecd-8853-c5eb963fa647"},{"attributes":{"block_kind":"paragraph"},"citation":"18.55.040","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/18.55.040","content_hash":"d62d24b1645cceb29aba0b4a4279d7cc165288a4827baae20796003d8f6332bb","heading":null,"ordinal":25,"parent_source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.55.040:section","schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.55.040:block:25","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/18.55.040","text":"“Dwelling, single-family attached” means a one-family dwelling attached to one other one-family dwelling by a common vertical wall that is unpierced and located along its common property line, and each dwelling located on a separate lot.","type":"paragraph","workbench_component_id":"93526411-3617-5e66-8195-4818ee73391f"},{"attributes":{"block_kind":"paragraph"},"citation":"18.55.040","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/18.55.040","content_hash":"5da0b24d3f8303673107d92640b1333beec12b5141a6b699cdec0f078266ddfd","heading":null,"ordinal":26,"parent_source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.55.040:section","schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.55.040:block:26","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/18.55.040","text":"“Dwelling, single-family detached” means a dwelling which is designed for and occupied by not more than one family and surrounded by open space or yards and which is not attached to any other dwelling by any means.","type":"paragraph","workbench_component_id":"034f5e2a-28f2-5fa2-a5ca-220e6b389369"},{"attributes":{"block_kind":"paragraph"},"citation":"18.55.040","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/18.55.040","content_hash":"fa3133f323c528d655dfe2d03d52d156516cf3b663e1c1b7a997a96a0dd933e9","heading":null,"ordinal":27,"parent_source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.55.040:section","schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.55.040:block:27","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/18.55.040","text":"“Dwelling, two-family (duplex)” means a structure on a single lot containing two dwelling units, each of which is totally separated from the other by an unpierced wall extending from ground to roof or an unpierced ceiling and floor extending from exterior wall to exterior wall, except for a common stairwell exterior to both dwelling units.","type":"paragraph","workbench_component_id":"bc34729f-e1a5-576e-bdc2-0b1a87cef8b6"},{"attributes":{"block_kind":"paragraph"},"citation":"18.55.040","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/18.55.040","content_hash":"8c4743c80934c0db2869681bee9d7c10f4e0ebe0bdbb5127b8cb69a28a6aa227","heading":null,"ordinal":28,"parent_source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.55.040:section","schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.55.040:block:28","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/18.55.040","text":"“Dwelling unit” consists of one or more rooms, including a bathroom and complete kitchen facilities, which are arranged, designed or used as living quarters for one family or household. (Ord. 20500 § 2, 7-30-24.)","type":"paragraph","workbench_component_id":"1a499737-28df-590b-9583-1c36b1d16ff2"},{"attributes":{"legacy_definition_id":"ks-topeka:tmc:18.55.040:def:day-care"},"citation":"18.55.040","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/18.55.040","content_hash":"e98a8da2e5b96151c8eb078eed7687cec8e56ff65ed2f9c854b8bf67e8359dd3","heading":null,"ordinal":0,"parent_source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.55.040:section","schema":"exais.workbench_com